### What happened?

I have the following css applied globally:

```css
svg {
  border-radius: 4px;
}
```

On safari, this will stop Tldraw from working:

* create selections 
* free-hand drawing

https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb6a8ea3-5949-4c63-9268-f64f1477a041

### How can we reproduce the bug?

Execute this at the Safari developer console:

```js
let s = document.createElement('style');
s.innerHTML = 'svg { border-radius: 4px; }';
document.head.appendChild(s);
```

and start draw
